{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/fe8479d34919978e318c80f02ab24f9a.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging Together \u2013 Co-op Dig, Grow, Have Fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig with friendship, fight like a rival! In co-op mode, grow together; in Treasure Hunt mode, outsmart your opponents and claim the treasure!\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/89713a5f4414c4c9f8c21a82b1ea4d0c.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig together, grow together, and reach the treasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/4fc4013fe00cc7f4e3c6e7e88a7f11ab.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic world full of falls, exploding dynamite, and unexpected events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/3689275db497c7a4a34b028b1e66152b.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digger, Scanner, Carrier, or Energy Master \u2013 the choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/f7c7d13b579e85a8f27f260b2ba24ee1.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship ends here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this competitive mode, the first to reach the treasure wins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/5fe37ec19a36adab1e3c19d94816cb82.avif?t=1772026999\" width=860 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start digging on the same map, push your rivals, block their paths with dynamite, and be the first to reach the treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate wallets, separate plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the price of a coffee, with its modern, stylized visuals, witty tone, and dynamic gameplay, Digging Together shows how chaotic, fun, and competitive playing together can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let the Digging Begin!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772026999\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772026999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1772026999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Scoop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3938040/155e048ff3fbb07924808c49cf967fa6411da85a.jpg"},{"name":"BOOM!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3938040/b6afaff50a1932b0840dc3536baa0eb6a485f219.jpg"},{"name":"Was That It?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3938040/ddfb8c5d51167d9ecd19038c675836336b4e7064.jpg"},{"name":"What Speed?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3938040/d1f779e7d50b96630c973e0111ac8b4e8c493fac.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/393