ite, and be the first to reach the treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate wallets, separate plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the price of a coffee, with its modern, stylized visuals, witty tone, and dynamic gameplay, Digging Together shows how chaotic, fun, and competitive playing together can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let the Digging Begin!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772026999\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772026999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1772026999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Suber Game Studio","Cem Bal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938040/081e366e86da2ddc5b94c09423c623a4a53643e2/header.jpg?t=1772026999","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938040/453560629/2c718c1629d02cc7e38fc32f489fa5816a838e07/1763730344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763731739","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938040/453560629/2c718c1629d02cc7e38fc32f489fa5816a838e07/1763730344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763731739","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938040/453560629/2c718c1629d02cc7e38fc32f489fa5816a838e07/1763730344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763731739","id":257235390,"name":"Di